$$<p>The Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Services Selection Commission (UPSSSC), Lucknow, has published the notification for its Combined Lower Subordinate Service (Intermediate Level) Main Examination, offering 1,784 government posts across state departments. The notification, advertisement number 26-Exam/2026, was released on 16 October 2026. But readers should note the dates carefully: applications do not open until 10 November 2026, and they close on 1 December 2026. This article is therefore a preparation guide as much as a news report, because the candidates who use the next two weeks well will be the ones who file clean forms on day one.</p>
<p>The single most important condition is the Preliminary Eligibility Test. Only candidates who appeared in the UPSSSC PET 2025 and hold a valid scorecard can apply. Candidates with zero or negative marks in PET 2025, on absolute or normalised scores, will not be shortlisted. Class 12 alone is not enough, and no fresh candidate can enter this round without a PET scorecard.</p>
<h2>At a glance</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Conducting body</th><td>Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Services Selection Commission (UPSSSC), Lucknow</td></tr>
<tr><th>Examination</th><td>Combined Lower Subordinate Service (Intermediate Level) Main Examination (PET-2025)/26</td></tr>
